{"id":"630020","name":"玉米面红豆卷馒头","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/630020/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"玉米面","amount":"180g"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"蜜红豆","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"5g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"碗中放入玉米面、白面、酵母粉和糖。","img":"images/630020/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入温水搅拌成絮状。","img":"images/630020/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"活成面团，加入一小勺的猪油。","img":"images/630020/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"猪油和面充分融合。","img":"images/630020/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"盖上保鲜膜醒发。","img":"images/630020/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"半个小时后，已经发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/630020/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"案板上撒上面粉，把发酵好的面团充分揉和排气。","img":"images/630020/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搓成长条，再切成小面剂。","img":"images/630020/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"把小面剂按扁。","img":"images/630020/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"擀成牛舌状。","img":"images/630020/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入红豆粒。","img":"images/630020/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"由下往上卷。","img":"images/630020/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"卷好的样子。","img":"images/630020/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"把封口处捏合。","img":"images/630020/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"再用擀面杖擀薄。","img":"images/630020/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"再一次由下往上卷。","img":"images/630020/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"玉米卷生坯就做好了，还做了几个馒头。","img":"images/630020/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"再次发酵15分钟。","img":"images/630020/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"二次发酵完毕，大火蒸15分钟。","img":"images/630020/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"蒸好的玉米红豆卷馒头。","img":"images/630020/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品。非常香甜松软又好吃。","img":"images/630020/step_21.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}